  "body": "### Summary\n\nAs a member, I want the GIF panel's search field to behave and look like the smiley picker's (the system search field), so that both pickers are consistent and the system owns the field's legibility and accessibility. Found in the review of the #856 fix (2026-11-13).\n\n### Scope\n- The smiley picker uses the system `.searchable` field (#600, `SmileyPickerView.swift:10,45`). The GIF panel keeps a hand-built `TextField` in a `safeAreaBar` (`GifPickerView.swift`), restyled as glass by #856.\n- Move the GIF panel to `.searchable`. Keep its disabled-while-idle state, submit, clear and VoiceOver labels.\n- Fix the comment at `GifPickerView.swift:129-130` if the field stays hand-built: the system makes glass frostier and higher-contrast under Reduce Transparency and Increase Contrast, not opaque.\n\n### Acceptance criteria\n- [ ] Same search field look and behaviour as the smiley picker, in light and dark, with Reduce Transparency and Increase Contrast.\n- [ ] Search, clear and the idle state work as today.\n\nDepends on #856 (merged first).\n\n---\n_Generated by [Claude Code](https://claude.ai/code)_",
